            <p class="faq-a">An engineer assesses roof or ground area, structural loading, shading and the existing electrical infrastructure, then confirms system sizing and expected generation. Surveys are provided at no cost.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How are quotations prepared?</summary>
            <p class="faq-a">Each quotation follows a site survey and sets out equipment, installation, expected generation and estimated payback. Quotations can be requested through the <a href="contact.html">consultation request page</a>.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Where are Kraft Power products available?</summary>
            <p class="faq-a">Products are supplied directly by the company, together with installation and ongoing support. Distribution and reseller enquiries arewelcome.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Which areas are served?</summary>
            <p class="faq-a">Residential, commercial and industrial projects are undertaken across the region. Remote consultations are available at no cost.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Are storage-only installations available?</summary>
            <p class="faq-a">Yes. Storage-only systems suit sites with existing panels, or those requiring backup power during outages.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
